ATTRIBUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FieldOps Pro evaluates Windows endpoints against the 42 rules of the ANSSI
Guide d'hygiene informatique, published by the Agence nationale de la securite
des systemes d'information (ANSSI), Republique francaise.

The rule numbering and rule titles are ANSSI's. FieldOps Pro is an independent
implementation and is not endorsed by, affiliated with, or certified by ANSSI.
Compliance findings produced by this software represent the assessment of this
software alone.

