THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FieldOps Pro can optionally call the Anthropic API for narration, severity
classification and remediation guidance. That capability is off unless an API
key is configured, and no feature depends on it: every AI-using script has a
deterministic local path. See DOCS/AI-INTEGRATION.md.

Use of the Anthropic API is governed by Anthropic's own terms, not by this
licence. FieldOps Pro transmits diagnostic findings to that service when the
capability is enabled; operators are responsible for determining whether that
is appropriate for their data.


BUNDLED FONTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The ANSSI diagnostic report embeds three typefaces so that the document renders
identically on every machine, offline. They are redistributed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1, which permits bundling; the full licence text for each
accompanies the font files.

  Spectral         Copyright 2017 Production Type
                   ASSETS/fonts/LICENSES/spectral-OFL.txt
  Inter            Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors
                   ASSETS/fonts/LICENSES/inter-OFL.txt
  JetBrains Mono   Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
                   ASSETS/fonts/LICENSES/jetbrains-mono-OFL.txt

The bundled files are subsets: only the glyphs the report can produce (Latin,
Latin-1 Supplement and typographic punctuation) are retained, which is why they
are a fraction of the size of the originals. Subsetting is a Modified Version
under OFL 1.1; the Reserved Font Names are unchanged and the fonts are not sold
separately. Sources: the @fontsource distributions of the upstream projects.
